(26, 'Two days half yearly review of Aatmanirbhar LBS held', '<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\">March 5, 2023: Dang: Two days half yearly review workshop of Aatmanirbhar LBS has kicked off at Hotel Plaza in Ghorahi Dang.</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><strong><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1677997012.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"820\" height=\"426\" /></strong><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\">The half yearly review is being held from March 5-6, 2023 and all the staff nearly 110 workers including branch managers, accountants, field assistants from 21 branches are attending this review workshop.</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1677996775.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"714\" height=\"475\" /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\">The review workshop was inaugurated by RWDC founding chairpern and promoter of Aatmanirbhar LBS Aasmani Chaudhary amidst a program held here in Ghorahi.</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1677996743.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"831\" height=\"451\" /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\">Present on this occasion were president of Aatmanirbhar LBS miss Meera Chaudhary, Chief Executive Officer Saugat Bir Chaudhary, indpendent steering committee member and advocate Goma Mahara etc.</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1677997096.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"972\" height=\"460\" /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\">All senior staff members including Nep Bahadur Chaudhary, Kalidas Chaudhary, Binay Chaudhary, Susila Giri were present on the occasion.</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\">Also read this by clicking the following links</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://farakkon.com/main-news/66203/?fbclid=IwAR0WjI7WySzWs3LeoD9YsFsMw1cGZDfCag5l-FMXZauFZCL6CLyUltLlONM\">https://farakkon.com/main-news/66203/?fbclid=IwAR0WjI7WySzWs3LeoD9YsFsMw1cGZDfCag5l-FMXZauFZCL6CLyUltLlONM</a></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://gsamachar.com/?p=25551&amp;fbclid=IwAR0i_eI6bjux2dazeLwjuYNfRZyTX_ZLrt6HQ56LLfKDKx-fEoxStNoZcoY\">https://gsamachar.com/?p=25551&amp;fbclid=IwAR0i_eI6bjux2dazeLwjuYNfRZyTX_ZLrt6HQ56LLfKDKx-fEoxStNoZcoY</a></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1xmvt09 x1lliihq x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x xudqn12 x3x7a5m x6prxxf xvq8zen xo1l8bm xzsf02u x1yc453h\" dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://epatranews.com/2023/03/05/1967?fbclid=IwAR2eVOyT2YYDccE3C-B5fyxGu7Cj1SkKexuoPAVSJcdRXOsTJdqeChncwdg\">https://epatranews.com/2023/03/05/1967?fbclid=IwAR2eVOyT2YYDccE3C-B5fyxGu7Cj1SkKexuoPAVSJcdRXOsTJdqeChncwdg</a></span></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'inauguartion.jpg', '2023-03-05 00:19:00', '2023-03-06 19:31:07'),
(27, 'वित्तीय साक्षरता अभिमुखीकरण कार्यक्रम तथा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग वार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी सम्पन्न', '<div>\r\n<div class=\"\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div id=\"jsc_c_6r\" class=\"x1iorvi4 x1pi30zi x1swvt13 x1l90r2v\" data-ad-comet-preview=\"message\" data-ad-preview=\"message\">\r\n<div class=\"x78zum5 xdt5ytf xz62fqu x16ldp7u\">\r\n<div class=\"xu06os2 x1ok221b\">\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xdj266r x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1680019276.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" />March 28. 2023: ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रद्वारा प्रवर्द्धित आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लि. शाखा कार्यालय बैजापुरकाे आयोजनामा वित्तीय साक्षरता अभिमुखीकरण कार्यक्रम तथा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग वार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी आज मिति २०७९/१२/१४ गते सम्पन्न भएकाे छ ।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1680019314.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">बैजापुर गा.पा. वाड नं. ४ काे सचिब हाेम सूर्य के.सी. ज्यूकाे प्रमुख आतिथ्यमा कार्यक्रम सम्पन्न भएकाे थियाे । कार्यक्रममा अतिथिकाे रुपमा संस्थाकाे प्रमुख कार्यकारी अधिकृत साेगत वीर चाैधरी, ई.प्र.का. बैजापुरकाे प्र.ना.उ. प्रनानी प्रविन डि.सी., पत्रकार महासंघ बाँकेकाे सहसचिब हेमन्त चाैधरी, ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रकाे कार्यक्रम अधिकृत हित बहादुर थापा रहनु भएकाे थियाे ।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=664903605639251\">https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=664903605639251</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">कार्यक्रममा ४ उत्कृष्ट केन्द्र र ३ सफल उद्यमीहरुलाई सम्मान तथा पुरस्कृत गरिएकाे थियाे । मानव संसाधन प्रमुख नेप बहादुर चाैधरीकाे स्वागत मन्तब्यबाट शुरुवात भएकाे कार्यक्रमकाे सहजिकरण कर्जा अधिकृत कालीदास चाैधरीले गर्नु भएकाे थियाे ।</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"jsc_c_6s\" class=\"x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x10l6tqk\">\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62\">\r\n<div class=\"xqtp20y x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x10l6tqk x13vifvy\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x10l6tqk\">\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62\">\r\n<div class=\"xqtp20y x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x10l6tqk x13vifvy\"><img class=\"x1ey2m1c xds687c x5yr21d x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy xh8yej3\" src=\"https://scontent.fkep2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/337998456_1446616976142804_3446090800113668756_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600&amp;_nc_cat=111&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=8bfeb9&amp;_nc_ohc=zREbUszfFn8AX89_Qov&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fkep2-1.fna&amp;oh=00_AfBHTltQSK3vMeZ4eqNhm05dKOZNhTnyYLJTV20CP_aMOg&amp;oe=6427A217\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"xua58t2 xzg4506 x1ey2m1c x9f619 xds687c x47corl x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x10l6tqk\">\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62\">\r\n<div class=\"xqtp20y x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x10l6tqk x13vifvy\"><img class=\"x1ey2m1c xds687c x5yr21d x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy xh8yej3\" src=\"https://scontent.fkep2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/337733595_937311863971367_8482683870515066378_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600&amp;_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=8bfeb9&amp;_nc_ohc=cBSDxKXguU4AX9wRyTO&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fkep2-1.fna&amp;oh=00_AfDk_HHhD3-0jpsPkpgbRT8fSFDnSa1lVGxBh0CvE_5QxQ&amp;oe=6428CF94\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"xua58t2 xzg4506 x1ey2m1c x9f619 xds687c x47corl x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x1o1ewxj x3x9cwd x1e5q0jg x13rtm0m x1ey2m1c xds687c xg01cxk x47corl x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy x1ebt8du x19991ni x1dhq9h xobhos8\" data-visualcompletion=\"ignore\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x10l6tqk\">\r\n<div class=\"x6ikm8r x10wlt62\">\r\n<div class=\"xqtp20y x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x10l6tqk x13vifvy\"><img class=\"x1ey2m1c xds687c x5yr21d x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy xh8yej3\" src=\"https://scontent.fkep2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/338158928_135364926156433_6215422044608753189_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600&amp;_nc_cat=104&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=8bfeb9&amp;_nc_ohc=0XsxjjW9JOYAX_4eRyR&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fkep2-1.fna&amp;oh=00_AfB68EiU2VoqtdY5jTX89idWDjgdHy71AeKIClrTP_K7xQ&amp;oe=642755D2\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"xua58t2 xzg4506 x1ey2m1c x9f619 xds687c x47corl x10l6tqk x17qophe x13vifvy\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"x168nmei x13lgxp2 x30kzoy x9jhf4c x6ikm8r x10wlt62\" data-visualcompletion=\"ignore-dynamic\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"x1n2onr6\">\r\n<div class=\"x6s0dn4 xi81zsa x78zum5 x6prxxf x13a6bvl xvq8zen xdj266r xktsk01 xat24cr x1d52u69 x889kno x4uap5 x1a8lsjc xkhd6sd xdppsyt\">\r\n<div class=\"x9f619 x1n2onr6 x1ja2u2z x78zum5 x2lah0s x1qughib x1qjc9v5 xozqiw3 x1q0g3np xykv574 xbmpl8g x4cne27 xifccgj\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'active', 'Subir', 'audience.jpg', '2023-03-28 10:17:32', '2023-05-25 20:07:01'),
(28, 'Badalpur branch holds center chiefs\'s annual review and financial literacy', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1680681135.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />April 5, 2023: Ghorahi: Aatmanirbhar LBSm Badalpur branch has organized on day workshop on center chiefs\' annual review and financial literacy on April 5, 2023, in Banke.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The program was attended by over 70 rural women who are clients of this microfinance company. The Chief Executive Officer (CEO) Saugat Bir Chaudhary was the chief guest on the occasion while Kalidas Chaudhary of the central office moderated the program.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1680681169.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Other senior central staff who facilitated the program included Nirmal Chaudhary, Nep Bahadur Chaudhary, and Binay Chaudhary.&nbsp; Aatnirbhar LBS currently works with more than 50000 rural women in dispersing microloans based on group collateral.</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'badalpur2.jpg', '2023-04-05 02:08:22', '2023-04-05 02:08:22'),
(29, 'वित्तीय साक्षरता अभिमुखीकरण कार्यक्रम तथा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग वार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681175772.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" />April 10, 2023: ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रद्वारा प्रवर्द्धित आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लि. शाखा कार्यालय घाेराही दाङकाे आयोजनामा वित्तीय साक्षरता अभिमुखीकरण कार्यक्रम तथा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग वार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी आज मिति २०७९/१२/२७ गते घाराही दाङमा सम्पन्न भएकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681175800.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>संस्थाकाे प्रमुख कार्यकारी अधिकृत साेगत वीर चाैधरी ज्यू काे प्रमुख आतिथ्यतामा कार्यक्रम सम्पन्न भएकाे थियाे । कार्यक्रममा ४ उत्कृष्ट केन्द्र , ५ जना उत्कृष्ट उद्येमी, १ बचत कर्ता र १२ अनुशासित केन्द्रहरुलाई सम्मान तथा पुरस्कार प्रदान गरिएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681175843.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>शाखा प्रबन्धक तिर्सना चाैधरीकाे सभाध्यक्षतामा सम्पन्न कार्यक्रममा कार्यक्रम माथि प्रकाश संस्थाकाे मानव संसाधान प्रमुख नेप बहादुर चाैधरीले गर्नु भएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681175876.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>कार्यक्रममा संस्थाकाे शेयरधनी माधवा पाेख्रेल, ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रकाे सल्लाहकार तथा समाजसेवी रजनी श्रेष्ठ , कार्यक्रम अधिकृत हित बहादुर थापा ज्यूले शुभकामना मन्तब्य राख्नु भएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681175900.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>लेखापाल दसरथ चाैधरीकाे स्वागत मन्तब्यबाट शुरुवात भएकाे कार्यक्रमकाे सहजिकरण कर्जा बिभाग प्रमुख काली दास चाैधरीले गर्नुभएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://gsamachar.com/?p=26347&amp;fbclid=IwAR2D_a217Hf09dt_6C1ii5UF2gm0gONgJxQP2sYBq-3qmbSI4QWnL4zT-Zg\">https://gsamachar.com/?p=26347&amp;fbclid=IwAR2D_a217Hf09dt_6C1ii5UF2gm0gONgJxQP2sYBq-3qmbSI4QWnL4zT-Zg</a></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'Dang 5.jpg', '2023-04-10 19:33:31', '2023-04-10 22:17:49'),
(30, 'आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लि. काे चाैथाे वार्षिक साधारणसभा सम्पन्न', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681435648.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1356\" />April 13, 2023: ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रद्वारा प्रवर्द्धित आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लि. काे आज चाैथाे वार्षिक साधारणसभा सम्पन्न भएकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p>संस्थाकाे अध्यक्ष मिरा चाैधरी ज्यू काे सभाध्यक्षतामा सम्पन्न कार्यक्रमकाे प्रमुख अतिथि घाेराही उ.म.न.पा. १५काे अध्यक्ष रमेस पाण्डे रहनुभएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681435732.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" /></p>\r\n<p>यसैगरी विषेश अतिथिकाे रुपमा वडा न. १३ काे अध्यक्ष दुल्लुराम पाेख्रेल , अतिथिकाे रुपमा संस्थाकाे संस्थापक अध्यक्ष आसमानी चाैधरी, प्रमुख कार्यकारी अधिकृत साेगत वीर चाैधरी, पत्रकार महासंघ दाङकाे उपाध्यक्ष वसुन्धरा गाैतम, नेपाल टेलिभिजन संवादाता तथा प्रेस युनियन दाङकाे अध्यक्ष सन्ताेष सुवेदी, रेडियो मध्यपश्चिमकाे समाचार संम्पादक छवि पुरी, गाेरक्ष राष्ट्रिय दैनिककाे संवादाता अमरराज आचार्य लगायत संचालक समिति सदस्य टिकाराम चाैधरी, अरुणा कुमारी चाैधरी, मिना गिरी, स्वतन्त्र संचालक गाेमा महरा रहनुभएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1681435904.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" /></p>\r\n<p>सभाले चार बर्षकाे लागि पुनः निरविराेध रुपमा ५ सदस्यीय संचालक समिति चयन गरेकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p>समितिमा पुनः अध्यक्ष मिरा चाैधरी, सदस्य टिकाराम चाैधरी, अरुणा कुमारी चाैधरी, मिना गिरी र स्वतन्त्र संचालक गाेमा महरा रहनु भएकाेछ ।</p>\r\n<p>संचालक समिति सदस्य मिना गिरीकाे स्वागत मन्तब्यबाट शुरुवात भएकाे कार्यक्रमकाे सहजिकरण कर्जा अधिकृत कालीदास चाैधरीले गर्नु भएकाे थियाे ।</p>\r\n<p>click the following links to read news about this event.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://gsamachar.com/?p=26385&amp;fbclid=IwAR3tE3lDm7sP1kNsWKd2qJB4MdsqCmJkPjawUK4PZI7Nrqr_bSbbVBvY6vE\">https://gsamachar.com/?p=26385&amp;fbclid=IwAR3tE3lDm7sP1kNsWKd2qJB4MdsqCmJkPjawUK4PZI7Nrqr_bSbbVBvY6vE</a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/messenger_media?attachment_id=1188197171861515&amp;message_id=mid.%24gABkML51o2OGNrttx4WHfZYf-p5da&amp;thread_id=7050273061656801\">https://www.facebook.com/messenger_media?attachment_id=1188197171861515&amp;message_id=mid.%24gABkML51o2OGNrttx4WHfZYf-p5da&amp;thread_id=7050273061656801</a></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'main photoes.jpg', '2023-04-13 19:33:44', '2023-04-13 20:44:53'),
(31, 'Center chiefs\' annual review and financial literacy program held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" />April 21, 2023: Tulsipur branch \"A\" of Aatmanirbhar LBS held its center chiefs\' annual review and financial literacy program at the conference hall of Ekanta Hotel in Tulsipur on April 20, 2023.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066329.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" /></p>\r\n<p>The program was attended by over 250 women participants representing various centers formed by this microfinance company. The program was graced by its Chief Executive Officer -CEO -Shogat Bir Chaudhary and presided over by Tulsipur branch manager Jugram Chaudhary.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066362.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Various ward chairs and members of Tulsipur Sub Metropolis were also present on the occasion while the local unit of police also was represented by one Police inspector during the program. The program was conducted by the central head of human resources Nep Bahadur Chaudhary supported by other staff members.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066399.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" /></p>\r\n<p>Speaking during the program, the ward representative of ward no 9 expressed his view against the ongoing illegal social media campaigns that were apt to tarnish the image of microfinance services in rural areas.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066424.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" /></p>\r\n<p>Speaking during the same program the representative of the security agency from the police department said that Microfinance Company like Aatmanirbhar LBS has reduced gender violence and domestic violence to a greater extent by creating jobs and self-employment for the poor and rural women which must be appreciated by all. He also stressed that the government also should promote such institutions in the country.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066452.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>He asked the center chiefs not to pay attention to the people who are illegally canvassing against the Laghubitta institutions in the country.</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066484.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"540\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>Addressing the audience of the center chiefs\' review meeting the CEO -Shogat Bir Chaudhary said that no loans will ever be exempted as there are no such provisions in the country because the loans are public money which is circulated as microloans from the public savings, share holders\' capital and big amount of loan taken from A class banks which are again public money.</p>\r\n<p>Soon after the remarks of CEO Shogat Chaudhary the floor was opened for the center chiefs to give their feedback to the company and then the closing remarks were made by branch manager Jugram Chaudhary after which the program came to an end.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066522.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Similarly, the Shree gaun branch of this company also held its center chiefs\' annual review and financial literacy program on April 21, 2023.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066585.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The program was attended by over 140 rural women who are clients of this microfinance company. The CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary along with security personnel attended this meeting.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>fjjfjlaj<img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682066628.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'awards3.jpg', '2023-04-21 02:59:36', '2023-04-21 03:04:44'),
(32, 'Aatmanirbhar LBS price range between 371.82 to 1115.46', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1682841930.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"946\" />April 30, 2023: आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लि . काे आज Listing कार्य सम्पन्न भएकाे छ । २०८०/०१/१९ गते देखि काराेवार शुरु हुँदै । Public Range : Rs. 371.82 to Rs. 1115.46</p>\r\n<p>Aatmanirbhar LBS\'s listing has been completed after a meeting with the Chief Executive Officer of Nepal Stock Exchange in Kathmandu on April 30, 2023.</p>\r\n<p>The meeting minute suggests that the public price range of Aatmanirbhar LBS is between 371.82 to 1115.46.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>click the following links for details</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.arthatantra.com/2023/04/30/149494/?fbclid=IwAR3MFUr5QpU1loRpTkRmL5sMH2aPCp69qVIRlIOpjRD7NRIn4IKQxCgy5ms\">https://www.arthatantra.com/2023/04/30/149494/?fbclid=IwAR3MFUr5QpU1loRpTkRmL5sMH2aPCp69qVIRlIOpjRD7NRIn4IKQxCgy5ms</a></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'active', 'Subir', '344064240_9528754420475709_3443913273695646054_n.jpg', '2023-04-30 02:20:35', '2023-04-30 02:23:26'),
(33, 'ALBS holds management training for staff', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1683339569.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />May 5, 2023: Aatmanirbhar Laghubitta Bittiya Sanstha Ltd (ALBS) has held management training for its staff on May 5, 2023 at Hotel City Plaza in Ghorahi.</p>\r\n<p>also click the link bellow to see video on struggle against struggle committee</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch?v=1204268730264816\">https://www.facebook.com/watch?v=1204268730264816</a></p>\r\n<p>The training program was inaugurated by the ALBS founding chairperson Aasmani Chaudhary.&nbsp; The program was graced by ALBS current chair Miss Mira Chaudhary and CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1683339241.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>At least 70 participants attended the microfinance management training. The trainers included CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary, Kalidas Chaudhary, Nirmal Chaudhary, Nep Bahadur Chaudhary, Binay Chaudhary, Jeepshara Gharti, Puran Adhikari among others.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1683339288.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रद्वारा प्रवर्द्धित संस्था आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लि. काे आयोजनामा सम्पन्न लघुवित्त संचालन तथा ब्यबस्थापन तालिमका केही झलकहरु ।</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=664903605639251\">https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=664903605639251</a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1683339322.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', '344749393_618442616845720_462492710131409663_n.jpg', '2023-05-05 20:30:36', '2023-06-05 04:15:49'),
(35, 'Nepal government\'s attention drawn towards misgiving created against Microfinance services', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1687791379.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />June 26, 2023, Dang: Coalition of nearly 40 Laghubitta Bittiya Sansthas active in Dang district on June 26, 2023 have collectively submiited an attention letter to the Chief Disgtrict Officer (CDO) of Dang district to remind him of all anomilies being created against microfinance services of Laghubittas across the nation by some miscreants.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1687792317.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"498\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1687791407.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Speaking to the journalists before meeting with CDO of Dang district, the chief executive officer of Aatmanirbhar Labhubitta and member of central task force of laggubita association Shogat Bir Chaudhary said that for the last nearly 12 to 14 months there have been repeated attacks upon most of the Laghubitta companies by some miscreants who are politically motivated and are bent on attacking laghubiita services by spreading rumors in different ways.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1687791431.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>He also said some people who are politically motivated and protected are extorting money from the vulnerable and innocent clients of laghubitta companies and creating a big trouble for such companies functioning by following the financial rules and rugulations set in by Nepal Rastra Bank.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1687791456.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The CDO of Dang district while meeting with the members of task force of laghubitta companies assured that he would take action if the agitators dare to padlock the microfinance companies in future. The CDO also got ready to take a photograph with the delegation team members.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1687791487.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>click the links below for video of this delegation that met with CDO of Dang&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=2350424685144944\">https://www.facebook.com/watch/?v=2350424685144944</a></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'CDO ph.jpg', '2023-06-26 09:14:45', '2023-06-26 09:27:06'),
(36, 'तुलसीपुर उपमहानगरपालिकाका २ विद्यालयमा छात्रवृत्ति वितरण गरिएकाे छ', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688400960.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" />July 3, 2023, Dang Ghorahi: तुलसीपुर उपमहानगरपालिकाका २ विद्यालयमा छात्रवृत्ति वितरण गरिएकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688400989.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रद्वारा प्रर्वद्धित आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेडको आयोजनामा सामाजिक उत्तरदायित्व अन्तरगत छात्रवृत्ति वितरण गरिएकाे हाे ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688401011.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>तुलसिपुर उपमहानगपालिका वडा नं १३, रनियापुर श्री जनज्योति माध्यमिक विद्यालय र तुलसिपुर उपमहानगरपालिका ११, उरहरीकाे अमर माध्यमिक विद्यालयमा अध्ययनरत जेहेन्दार, सिमान्तकृत, बिपन्न समुदायका ८० जना विद्यार्थीहरुलाई छात्रवृति स्वरुप विद्यालय पाेषाक वितरण गरिएकाे हाे।</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688401036.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', '347630909_1011179803659970_1890304090405724331_n.jpg', '2023-07-03 10:33:36', '2023-07-03 10:33:36'),
(37, 'ALBS conducts AML/CFT and Branch operation training', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688658388.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />July 7,2023, Dang Ghorahi:&nbsp; Two days training on Branch Operation Management, Anti Money Laundering (AML) and Countering Financing Terrorism (CFT) for employees of Aatmanirbhar LBS (ALBS) has ended on July 7, 2023 in Ghorahi at hotel City Plaza.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The training was organized by Sunita Trust Foundation (STF) on July 6 and 7, 2023.</p>\r\n<p>As many as 100 participants representing branch managers, accountants, marketing assistants and office support staff attended the two days training on AML/CFT and Branch operations.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688658439.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The first day training was initiated with formal inauguration of the training by Chief Executive Officer -CEO-Shogat Bir Chaudhary by kindling the oil lamp.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688658469.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The central staff Binay Chaudhary moderated the program. Resource persons including Nirmal Chaudhary, Nep Bahadur Chaudhary, Puran Adhikari, Kalidas Chaudhary presented their various thematic issues regarding the operation of branch offices and clients and current situations.</p>\r\n<p>The CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary also delivered his training on current challenges and methods of coping up with the situation emerging challenges in the field of service delivery of microfinance and repayment.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688740653.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The second day training was started with the recap of the previous day which was moderated by senior staff Sushila Giri of central office.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688740681.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />Then the session was taken by the resource person H.B. Thapa on Anti Money Laundering (AML) and Countering Financing Terrorism (CFT) with various provisions of punishments for those involved in AML and CFT.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688740703.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Similarly, the other training resource person Kamal Regmi delivered his deliverance on Banking rules and obligations of the staff and narrated how the fraud activities take place inside the financial instutitons and punishements given for each banking crime.</p>\r\n<p>Then the day was concluded with concluding remarks of few staff, trainer HB Thapa and CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1688740729.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.karobardaily.com/news/227688?fbclid=IwAR3mRN9C1q4vQqhkAGlrpuh5FhiWBI80_dqjXkhtrH6wFdOEZQ2xB4ebgrc\">https://www.karobardaily.com/news/227688?fbclid=IwAR3mRN9C1q4vQqhkAGlrpuh5FhiWBI80_dqjXkhtrH6wFdOEZQ2xB4ebgrc</a></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'boss.jpg', '2023-07-06 10:03:52', '2023-07-19 09:58:25'),
(38, 'Aatmanirbhar provides Rs 2,17,600 to family members of Suntali Gandharba', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1691579673.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"878\" height=\"417\" />August 9, 2024: Ghorahi Dang: Aamanirbhar LBS has handed over Rs 2,17,600 as facility of loan insurance to the family dependents of Mrs Suntali Gandharba who recenlty died of illness.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Suntali was one of the members of saving group formed at center no 64 located at Ghorahi Sub Metropolis ward no 11, Nayabasti.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The loan insurance amount was handed over to the family members of Suntali at a program held in Ghorahi and the amount was handed over by Aatmanirbhar LBS senior human resource persons Nep Bahadur Chaudhary on August 9, 2023.</p>\r\n<p>Aatmanirbhar LBS has a policy of providing loan insurance to any member who may die during the loan repyament cycle. The deceased member\'s family next of kin are the main beneficiaries of the loan insurance.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1691579697.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"973\" /></p>\r\n<p>अाज मिति २०८०/०४/२४ गतेका दिन यस आत्मनिर्भर लघुबित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड बाट गठन भएको केन्द्र न ६४, घोराही ११ नयाँबस्तीका सदस्य सुन्तली गन्दर्भकाे बिरामी भई असामयिक निधन भएकोले कर्जा बिमा सुबिधा रु . २,१७,६००/ रुपैयाँ उहाँकाे परिवारलाई प्रदान गरियाे ।</p>', 'active', 'Subir', '363441415_1104325520972068_1398520450275427006_n.jpg', '2023-08-09 05:30:05', '2023-08-09 05:30:05'),
(39, 'Consultative workshop of CEOs and Study committee held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1692548549.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />August 20, 2023: Dang Ghorahi: Nepal Microfinance Bankers\'Association (NMBA) organzied a one day consultative workshop between Chief Executive Officers (CEOs) of NMBA and Consultative Study Committee in Kathmandu on August 20, 2023.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1692548575.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The consultative worksho discussed all challenges and problems encountered in the recent days.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>CEO of Aatmanirbhar LBS Shogat Bir Chaudhary also attended this consultative workshop today.</p>', 'active', 'Subir', '368297795_2553720611458321_6360918733766240354_n.jpg', '2023-08-20 10:38:22', '2023-08-20 10:38:22'),
(40, 'Annual review workshop of Aatmanirbhar LBS kicks off', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1693551861.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />September 1, 2023, Dang Ghorahi: Aatmanirbhar LBS has began its annual review workshop for the fiscal year 2079/2080 BS in Ghorahi Sub Metropolis at Hotel Super Lodge from September 1, 2023.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1693552160.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>The review workshop will be held for two consecutive days on September 1 and 2.</p>\r\n<p>The annual review workshop was formally inaugurated by the Chief Executive Officer (CE) Shogat Bir Chaudhary. Speaking during the key speech he said, \" we need to improve our relations with our clients with good manners\"</p>\r\n<p>He also said that the staff whould be ready to solve any challenges that may come up in deliverance of microfinance services in the rural areas.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1693551995.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The workshop is expected to discuss the progress reports of all branches of Aatmanirbhar LBS today. The works shop will also discuss ways to reduce the bad loans and strategies to deal with dissenting clients in the current situation.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1693643375.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>On the second day, September 2, the workshop discussed the comtemporary challenges and issues in the field of microfinance.</p>\r\n<p>Loan officer Kalidas Chaudhary, internal auditor Puran Adhikari, Senior central staff Sushila Giri, Human Resource chief Nep Bahadur Chaudhary respectively dealth with the reasons of bad loan and ways to recover the bad loans, Loan status and measures to take while doing loan analysis etc</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1693643564.png\" alt=\"\" />The workshop also explored the ways to encounter the challenges in microfinance in the current situation. AT the end of the program, selective participants including marketing assistants, accountants and branch managers expressed shared their learning with the rest of the counterparts.</p>\r\n<p>The second day workshop was concluded with the concluding remarks of CEO Shogat Chaudhary.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1693719048.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'participant 2.jpg', '2023-09-01 01:21:56', '2023-09-02 23:45:57'),
(41, 'कर्जा बिमा सुबिधा निजको परिवार सुरेश बिक लाइ रु। १९२०००। प्रदान गरियो ।', '<p>September 25, 2023:</p>\r\n<p>ग्रामिण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र बाट प्रवर्धन भएको यस आत्मनिर्भर लघुबित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड शाखा कार्यालय लमही बाट गठन भएको केन्द्र नं ६७,६८,३४ मा बित्तीय साक्षारता अभिमुखीकरण तालीम तथा केन्द्र नं ३४ मा आबद्ध रहेकी साबित्रा बिकको मृत्यु भएकोले कर्जा बिमा सुबिधा निजको परिवार सुरेश बिक लाइ रु। १९२०००। प्रदान गरियो ।</p>\r\n<p>click the link below to see the exclusive interview of CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary on current status of microfinance companies.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ktmvoice.com/interview/52176.html/?fbclid=IwAR1wuTepjHkN53Sga_ji_mw-gvC6QwsE14WUooo353meHU88-cT-rWLCjDU\">https://www.ktmvoice.com/interview/52176.html/?fbclid=IwAR1wuTepjHkN53Sga_ji_mw-gvC6QwsE14WUooo353meHU88-cT-rWLCjDU</a></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'Bima 2222.jpg', '2023-09-25 06:58:47', '2023-09-29 09:15:29'),
(42, 'आत्मनिर्भर लघुबित्त बित्तीय संस्था लि.राष्ट्रिय कर दिबश 2080 को अबसरमा सम्मानित', '<div dir=\"auto\">November 23, 2023 Dang Ghorahi-15:&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र दाङले प्रबर्द्धन गरेको आत्मनिर्भर लघुबित्त बित्तीय संस्था लि.आर्थिक बर्ष 2078/079 मा बैकं तथा वित्तीय संस्था तर्फ सबैभन्दा धेरै आयकर दाखिला गरे बापत राष्ट्रिय कर दिबश 2080 को अबसरमा आज सम्मानित भएको छ !</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1700732700.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1700732725.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x6umtig x1b1mbwd xaqea5y xav7gou x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz xt0b8zv x1qq9wsj xo1l8bm\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B2%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8B?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVE7zm_WAoZ5rX4le-b0KhkN8uRRrqog7ja9D0EbR_-pCZrVy8rMv1t0MTl2IQWXravq4qNo9kYTZHpdexiz3brQ3Bsv6ahaHU3px7em9cR4WtldPLeWS3Sl-aWIqQxFwvVPyMBi_7DRLENHBiLUz64KJNuoPi3i0_rDDj54-KlutfMkKL2VZRW_XYjDcFHVMs&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#नेपालको</a> गरिबी निबारण, रोजगारी सिर्जना, महिला शसक्तिकरण र आर्थिक रुपान्तरणका लागि आत्मनिर्भर लघुबित्तले गर्दै आएको यो काम अझ बृहत् रुपमा फैलिदै जाओस हार्दिक शुभकामना छ !</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">click the following links to see the video clip of CEO Saugat Bir Chaudhary on being awarded.</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://samanantar.com/?p=12510&amp;fbclid=IwAR1QfRYUqIv-RGGVaFR7krFmKPUXSiQZsNb52kXF8O4S5VDP6sZWmapVDrw\">https://samanantar.com/?p=12510&amp;fbclid=IwAR1QfRYUqIv-RGGVaFR7krFmKPUXSiQZsNb52kXF8O4S5VDP6sZWmapVDrw</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>', 'active', 'Subir', 'main boss.jpg', '2023-11-23 04:00:33', '2023-11-26 22:47:00'),
(43, 'Visitors from Nepal Rastra Bank visit interpreneurs of Aatmanirbha LBS', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1703940677.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" />December 30, 2023: Dang Ghorahi: Visitors from Nepal Rastra Bank in the company of Aatmanirbhar LBS chairperson Meera Chaudhary, CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary, and internal auditor Puran Adhikari have met with local entrepreneurs and held discussions on prospective small agribusiness.<img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1703940707.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" /></p>\r\n<p>नेपाल रास्ट्र बैंकबाट पाल्नुभएका आदरणीय अतिथि ज्युहरु लगायत यस आत्मनिर्भर लघुबित्त बित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेडकाे अध्यक्ष श्री मिरा चौधरी ज्यू र प्रमुख कार्यकारी अधिकृत श्री सोगत वीर चौधरी ज्यु बाट समुहमा आबद्ध उद्यमी सदस्यहरुकाे ब्यवसाय अवलाेकन तथा छलफल गरिएकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1703940743.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'rastra bank 22.jpg', '2023-12-30 07:08:24', '2023-12-30 07:08:24'),
(44, '5th AGM of Aatmanirbhar LBS held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1705397175.jpg\" alt=\"\" />January 14, 2023: The 5th Annual General Convention (AGM) of Aatmanirbhar LBS was held on January 13, 2023, at Hotel Mala Inn in Ghorahi Sub Metropolis amidst a huge gathering of its shareholders.</p>\r\n<p>The AGM was formally inaugurated by its president Meera Chaudhary.</p>\r\n<p>Over 100 participants including the main shareholders, IPO shareholders, senior staff, Global IME representative,&nbsp; Insurance agent, media persons, and well-wishers attended the huge AGM function.</p>\r\n<p>The steering committee members of this microfinance institution including Tika Ram Chaudhary, Aruna Chaudhary, Mina Giri, Goma Mahara, and current president Meera Chaudhary, Chief Executive Officer Shogat Bir Chaudhary were present on the occasion, while election officer Dhan Singh Giri was also present during the AGM.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1705210579.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />The audience was welcomed by a welcome speech from senior staff Sushila Giri after which the president Meera Chaudhary read out the progress report of the financial institution including challenges encountered in the past.</p>\r\n<p>Then the floor was opened for the audience during which a few speakers spoke about the financial status of the company.</p>\r\n<p>Then the guests including media persons were allowed to speak to felicitate the microfinance company. Journalists such as Savin Priyason, Sarad Adhikari, and insurance agent Lok Raj Prajuli spoke on the occasion. Shareholder Bhim Kant Chaudhary also spoke on behalf of shareholders.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1705472809.jpg\" alt=\"\" />Then CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary delivered his speech about the ongoing challenges created by unseen agents and the lack of sympathy from the security agencies and government to protect the microfinance companies operating in the country to uproot the poverty from the rural communities. All the agenda presented before the huge AGM mass was passed by the AGM members.</p>\r\n<p>After this, the occasion was graced by the speech of founding chair Aasmani Chaudhary who spoke about the difficulties and challenges of starting this microfinance company in the past.</p>\r\n<p>This was followed by concluding remarks of President Meera Chaudhary who concluded the first session of this 5th AGM moderated by Parbati Basnet.</p>\r\n<p>Then the second session worked for the induction of two members from general members for the steering committee of this company. This process of election was conducted by the election officer -advocate Dhan Singh Giri and finally, two general members -Amar Bahadur Khadka and Krishna Bahadur Khatri were elected unopposed to the steering committee of this company.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1705211152.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />The two new members of the working committee were asked to take the oath of secrecy by President Meera Chaudhary in the presence of the election officer Dhan Singh Giri after which the AGM was closed and dispersed. The AGM has announced that the bonus will be divided among the shareholders.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1705210639.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1705211202.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', '5th AGM.jpg', '2024-01-13 23:52:25', '2024-01-17 00:42:03'),
(45, 'Credit Risk, Banking Fraud and Bad Loan Management Training Held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1706445972.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />Jan 28, 2024: Dang Ghorahi: One day of Credit Risk, Banking Fraud and Bad Loan Management Training has been held in Dang Ghorahi on January 28, 2024, at Rapti Super Lodge.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The training was organized and sponsored by First Microfinance Development Bank (FMDB) and Aatmanirbhar LBS&nbsp; jointly to promote skills and knowledge about controlling potential credit risk, banking fraud, and bad loan management.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1706441859.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />The training was aimed at enhancing the capacities of the branch managers and accountants of Aatmanirbhar LBS. Over 40 participants including branch managers, accountants, and the central team comprising of internal auditors, loan officers, and human resources head and Chief Executive Officer Shogat Bir Chaudhary attended the training.</p>\r\n<p>The training was chaired by CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary, and graced by CEO of FMDB Numanath Poudel as the chief guest, while the branch manager of Kumari Bank Ghorahi Kamala Regmi also was present on the occasion.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1706445869.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The first session of the training was delivered by Kamal Regmi, while the second session was delivered by Numanath Poudel of FMDB. The training comprised group discussion and question-answer sessions which explored the major challenges of bad loans and possible fraudulent activities that could occur in the management of the credits and dealing with the members of the microfinance services.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1706445829.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The program was moderated by Nep Bahadur Chaudhary and the concluding remarks were given by CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary after which the training program came to an end.</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'shogat.jpg', '2024-01-28 05:53:02', '2024-01-28 07:01:16');
INSERT INTO `highlights` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `status`, `added_by`, `featured_image`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(46, 'Fourth National Microfinance Members\' Summit held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1708219897.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" />Feb 18, 2024: Dang: The fourth National Microfinance Members\' Summit concluded in Kathmandu on February 18, which started on February 17, 2024.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1708219952.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" /></p>\r\n<p>The summit organized by CSD in Kathmandu was chaired by its chairperson Shankar Man Shrestha. Nepal government\'s finance minister Ram Sharant Mahat was the chief guest on the occasion while member of parliament Yogendra Mandal, and chair of Microfinance Association Ram Bahadur Yadav were the special guests on the occasion.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1708219997.jpg\" alt=\"\" />The acting chair of Nepal Rastra Bank, Nilam Dhungana Timilsinha was also the special guest on the occasion. The summit was attended by over 800 members, including staff chief executive officers of the microfinance companies.</p>\r\n<p>The first opening session of the summit was welcomed by its chair Shankar Man Shrestha which was followed by an address from the chief minister who said that the government would not tolerate any activity that would disturb the activities of the microfinance services.</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1708220044.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></strong>In the second session of the summit Dr. Prakash Kumar Shrestha, the director of Nepal Rastra Bank and coordinator of Monitoring and Evaluation said that microfinance services could be improved over time with some internal and external improvements.</p>\r\n<p>The summit also highlighted some of the best practices of the entrepreneurs ( who spoke during the plenary sessions) representing various microfinance companies in Nepal.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1708270404.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />On the second day on Feb 18, the plenary session on the significance of 3Zero Club in Nepal with three goals (Zero poverty, zero unemployment, and zero emission of carbon) was addressed by CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary of Aatmanirbhar LBS from Dang as the key speaker. The plenary session was presided over by Shankar Man Shrestha among others.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1708270175.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />Similarly, the group A plenary session on current difficulties faced by microfinance members and ways to solve them was efficiently moderated by Aasmani Chaudhary (promoter of Aatmanirbhar LBS and founding chair of RWDC) as the key speaker during the sessions.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Nearly 40 participants of Aatmanirbhar LBS including chief executive officer Shogat Bir Chaudhary, senior staff, and its promoter organization Rural Women Development Center and founding chair Aasmani Chaudhary, its chair Mira Chaudhary have taken part in his summit.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'gists with sasmani.jpg', '2024-02-17 19:49:19', '2024-02-19 22:29:31'),
(47, 'केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1709207240.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"483\" />Feb 29, 2024: आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड (साविक ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र ) काे आयोजनामा आज २०८०/११/१७ गते केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम गुलरीया बर्दियामा सम्पन्न भएको छ । कार्यक्रमका केही झलकहरु ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1709207425.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"483\" />Aatmanirbhar LBS has commenced its annual review workshop of center chiefs from the Bardia district. The panoramic glimpses follow:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1709207584.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"698\" height=\"471\" /></strong></p>\r\n<p>आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड (साविक ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र ) काे आयोजनामा आज २०८०/११/१८ गते केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम राजापुर बर्दिया (बदालपुर) मा सम्पन्न भएको छ ।</p>\r\n<p>-<img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1709293806.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"483\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'Biardia 55.jpg', '2024-02-29 06:08:18', '2024-03-01 06:10:46'),
(48, 'केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1709448195.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"916\" />March 4, 2024: आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड (साविक ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र ) शाखा कार्यालय बढैयातालकाे आयोजनामा आज २०८०/११/१९ गते केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम बढैयाताल बर्दियामा सम्पन्न भएको छ ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1709448303.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"916\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'Falugun 444.jpg', '2024-03-03 00:58:35', '2024-03-03 01:00:18'),
(49, 'बैजापुरमा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1710064474.jpg\" alt=\"\" />March 10, 2024: आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड (साविक ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र ) शाखा कार्यालय बैजापुर बाँकेकाे आयोजनामा आज २०८०/११/२७ गते केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम बाँकेको बैजापुरमा सम्पन्न भएको छ । कार्यक्रमका केही झलकहरु ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1710064820.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1710064562.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'Baijapur11.jpg', '2024-03-10 04:12:22', '2024-03-10 04:15:25'),
(50, 'Srigaun Center Chief Annual Review and Financial Literacy Training held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1710660288.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />March 17, 2023: Dang Ghorahi: Aatmanirbhar Laghubitta Bittiya Sanstha Pvt Ltd (Aatmanirbhar LBS) conducted its Annual Review and Financial Literacy program for its Srigaun area Center Chiefs on March 15, 2024.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1710660327.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />The review workshop was attended by over 130 rural women participants who are affiliated with Aatmanirbhar LBS centers to get the benefits of microfinance services.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1710660357.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />Various awards including cash and certificates were awarded to the best entrepreneurs and the best centers. They were also asked to share their experiences before other participants.</p>\r\n<p>The CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary, senior central staff Nep Bahadur Chaudhary, and Puran Adhikari were also present on the occasion to orient the participants on financial literacy. The program was facilitated by Nep Bahadur Chaudhary while the chief guest and CEO of Aatmanirbhar LBS Shogat Bir Chaudhary also sp&oacute;ke to the participants.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'Srigaun 11.jpg', '2024-03-17 01:42:37', '2024-03-17 01:51:37'),
(51, 'लमही दाङकाे केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंगकाे बार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1711082125.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"322\" />March 22, 2024 Dang Ghorahi:</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1711082147.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"322\" />ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र द्वारा प्रबर्द्धित आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड शाखा कार्यालय लमही दाङकाे आयोजनामा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंगकाे बार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी तथा वित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम आज मिति २०८०/१२/०८ गते लमहीमा सम्पन्न भएकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1711082169.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'lamahi audience.jpg', '2024-03-21 22:51:27', '2024-03-21 22:51:27'),
(52, 'Tulsipur branch center chief annual review workshop held', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1711704978.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />March 29, 2024, Dang Ghorahi:</p>\r\n<p>Aatmanirbhar LBS has organized its Tulsipur branch-based center chiefs\' annual review workshop and financial literacy training on March 29, amidst a function held in Tulsipur today.</p>\r\n<p>The review workshop was facilitated by Nep Bahadur Chaudhary while CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary addressed the audience of rural women in the program. Nearly 250 rural women attended this review workshop to keep themselves informed what is going on in the market of microfinance services.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1711705022.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Various awards related to best centers, best entrepreneurs and who saved the maximum amount of money were rewarded in the review workshop.</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'tulsipur main audience.jpg', '2024-03-29 03:52:08', '2024-03-29 03:52:08'),
(53, 'केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंगकाे बार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी भालुबाङमा सम्पन्न', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1712657697.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"483\" />April 9, 2024: Dang Ghorahi:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1712657726.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"810\" />ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र द्वारा प्रबर्द्धित आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड शाखा कार्यालय भालुवाङ दाङकाे आयोजनामा वित्तीय शाक्षरता तथा केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंगकाे बार्षिक समीक्षा गाेष्ठी कार्यक्रम आज मिति २०८०/१२/२७ गते भालुबाङमा सम्पन्न भएकाे छ ।</p>\r\n<p>click this link for media news related to this event</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://deukhuritoday.com/main-news/51015?fbclid=IwAR1A8tFL-FetLib9JhAdkI5YGJxa5XIizPcYn3GkIwGKcm902K_tJmxIw00_aem_Adm0EDOJmcECjyvU-Z1MLnzlm740uE9s7DPWn6ZkxVAJ-BGUVn0KdUlrraytoFGQA7kJ_z2-aqSC2datkj5lIahb\">https://deukhuritoday.com/main-news/51015?fbclid=IwAR1A8tFL-FetLib9JhAdkI5YGJxa5XIizPcYn3GkIwGKcm902K_tJmxIw00_aem_Adm0EDOJmcECjyvU-Z1MLnzlm740uE9s7DPWn6ZkxVAJ-BGUVn0KdUlrraytoFGQA7kJ_z2-aqSC2datkj5lIahb</a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1712658118.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"916\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'tirshana.jpg', '2024-04-09 04:31:05', '2024-04-11 03:15:03'),
(54, 'NARANAPUR BRANCH HOLDS ANNUAL REVIEW AND FINANCIAL LITERACY OF CENTER CHIEFS', '<p><img src=\"/upload/highlight/highlight_1713075088.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" />Aatmanirbhar LBS has organized an annual review and financial literacy training for Narayan branch center chiefs on April 10, 2024, amidst a function held today.</p>\r\n<p data-sider-select-id=\"4e08849f-beff-4a28-859d-8bf12dd324eb\">The program was attended by the RWDC founder as well as the founder of Aatmanirbha LBS Aasmani Chaudhary and current CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The program also awarded the best performances of the best centers, highest saving person and best entrepreneurs. More than 150 rural women participated in the review meeting.</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'nayaranpur audience.jpg', '2024-04-14 00:27:16', '2024-04-14 00:27:16');
INSERT INTO `introductions` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `status`, `added_by`, `views`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(2, 'Introduction', '<p>Aatmanirbhar Laghubitta Bittiya Sanstha Limited (Aatmabnirbhar LBS) was incorporated at the office of the company registrar under Nepal government&rsquo;s Ministry of Industry and Commerce Supplies on 29th November 2018 with a registration no as 202678/075/076 and a PAN no-606545622 to function as class &ldquo;D&rdquo; categorized bank recognized by Nepal Rastra Bank in Lumbini province of Nepal in pursuant of Sub-Section (I) of the companies Act 2006.</p>\r\n<p>Its central office is located in Ghorahi-Sub-Metropolis-15 in Dang district. It has a total of 21 branches spread across Dang, Banke and Bardiya district.</p>\r\n<p>History: The idea of Aatmanirbhar LBS was conceived early by Gramin Mahila Utthan Kendra (Rural Women Development Center-RWDC) when it was founded as a non-government organization to contribute to social development of rural women with respect to their literacy, income generation and empowerment.</p>\r\n<p>RWDC as its promoter organization in the early phase obtained the license from Nepal Rastra Bank to work as financial intermediary institution in 2060 BS (2004 AD) and started mobilizing women&rsquo;s saving groups and started disbursing micro-loans to needy households based on group&rsquo;s collateral.</p>\r\n<p>After Aatmabirbhar LBS was registered and recognized as a &ldquo;D&rdquo; class bank in Lumbini province of Nepal and it was duly handed over by its promoter organization RWDC in 2019 (2075 BS) as a separate banking entity (microfinance service provider) to function independently.</p>\r\n<p>Vision statement: Aatmanirbhar envisions to alleviating poverty of the poor, marginalized and disadvantaged rural communities.</p>\r\n<p>Mission statement: To provide micro-loans to rural poor and destitute households so as to improve their living standards, livelihood through economic empowerment by means of micro-entrepreneurship.</p>', 'active', 'Subir', 3130, '2021-12-16 04:41:42', '2024-04-22 06:49:42');
