(5, 'Over 955 client members receive financial literacy training', '<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1660288998.jpg\" alt=\"\" />August 12, 2022, Dang Ghorahi: Rural Women Development Center -RWDC (Gramin Mahila Utthan Kendra) in close coordination with Aatmanirbhar LBS has conducted financial literacy training targetting its client members in Tulsipur, Narayanpur, Ghorahi, Bhalubang and Rajpur rural municipality in the last fiscal year 2021/2022.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1660289029.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>A total of 955 client members ( 843 Janjati, 72 Dalit,s, and 50 others) of Aatmanirbhar LBS have been oriented on financial literacy which gives the rural women clients the very basic knowledge about how to save money regularly, how to make investments in business, and how to make the maximum use of the loans taken from microfinance on group collateral basis.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1660289080.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>The financial literacy training was provided at 36 places by RWDC facilitator Madhaba Pokharel.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1660289112.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>Aatmanirbhar LBS is another entity of RWDC which has been recognized as the D class microfinance institution (laghubitta Bittiya Sanstha limited) to engage in the reduction of poverty in the country.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1660289136.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"768\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1660289191.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', '297471662_1041879233162931_5215723263581754688_n.jpg', '2022-08-12 01:15:03', '2022-08-12 01:42:50'),
(6, 'बित्तिय तथा ब्याबशायीक साक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम सम्पन्न भयो', '<div class=\"\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div id=\"jsc_c_1z\" class=\"x1iorvi4 x1pi30zi x1swvt13 x1l90r2v\" data-ad-comet-preview=\"message\" data-ad-preview=\"message\">\r\n<div class=\"x78zum5 xdt5ytf xz62fqu x16ldp7u\">\r\n<div class=\"xu06os2 x1ok221b\">\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xdj266r x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1679482665.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />March 22, 2023: ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्रद्वारा प्रबर्द्धन गरिएको संस्था सुनिता ट्रष्ट फाउण्डेसनको आयोजना र आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त बित्तिय संस्थाको शाखा कार्यालय भालुबाङ शाखाको समन्वयमा २०७९/१२/०७ गतेका दिन गढवा गाउँपालिका -१ बडहरामा गठन गरिएको केन्द्र नं ६३,९५ र १०४ का महिला सदस्यहरुलाई बित्तिय तथा ब्याबशायीक साक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम सम्पन्न भयो ।</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1679482694.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2033\" height=\"1525\" /></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: start;\">उक्त अभिमुखिकरणमा भालुबाङ शाखाका सरला चाैधरी र सनिल चाैधरीले आ आफ्नो भनाई राख्नु भएको थियो भने सहजीकरण सुनिता ट्रष्ट फाउण्डेसनका शिबा चाैधरी र कमला शर्माले गर्नुभएको थियो ।</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', 'active', 'Subir', 'stf 6.jpg', '2023-03-22 05:14:29', '2023-03-22 05:14:29'),
(7, 'Aatmanirbhar LBS provides Financial Literacy Orientation to schools', '<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1701064574.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" />November 27, 2023, Dang:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Aatmanirbhar LBS- a D Class financial institution with its central office located in Ghorahi Sub Metropolis in Dang district has initiated an innovative campaign of providing orientation on financial literacy to various schools.</p>\r\n<p>On November 26, Aatmanirbhar LBS gave financial literacy orientation to the school students of primary school at Tuslpur Sub Metropolis ward no 14, Khausapur. where more than 40 students from classes 5 to 8 participated in the orientation program which was oriented by Nep Bahadur Chaudhary, Chief Executive Officer Shogat Bir Chaudhary while Kamala Chaudhary gave away the sanitary pads to the girls of the schools.<img src=\"/upload/training/training_1701064645.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>The orientations basically focussed on how to save money and how to approach the Laghubitta institutions to get a small amount of loan without collateral and on the basis of group collateral to start up the small business at the local level. The school teachers were also present on the occasion.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1701064694.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>\r\n<p>Similarly, the students of classes 11, 12, 10,9, and 8 at Bhojpur Higher Secondary School were given orientations on financial literacy on the same day where more than 100 students took part to learn what financial literacy is which was provided by Nep Bahadur Chaudhary and CEO Shogat Bir Chaudhary. The school teachers were also present on the occasion.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1701064751.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"1536\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'bhojpur 222.jpg', '2023-11-27 00:14:49', '2023-11-27 00:21:31'),
(8, 'केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम', '<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1709466504.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"483\" />March 3, 2024:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>आत्मनिर्भर लघुवित्त वित्तीय संस्था लिमिटेड (साविक ग्रामीण महिला उत्थान केन्द्र ) शाखा कार्यालय कारकाँदो बाँकेकाे आयोजनामा आज २०८०/११/२० गते केन्द्र प्रमुखहरुसंग बार्षिक समीक्षा गोष्ठी तथा बित्तीय शाक्षरता अभिमुखिकरण कार्यक्रम बाँकेको नेपालगञ्जमा सम्पन्न भएको छ ।</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"/upload/training/training_1709466536.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"483\" /></p>', 'active', 'Subir', 'NPJ 222.jpg', '2024-03-03 06:04:13', '2024-03-03 06:04:13');
